   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the paper Board's one `delivery/` (b10 s09-D05, s01-D32): each version's built paper sits under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/` (LaTeX, Word, cover letter), and each Section's own output under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/tNN_<section>/`. haipipe-paper-assemble builds the paper from the Sections' outputs;\nhaipipe-delivery owns the folder and the rule that only a person marks a send done. This topic settles what\npaper adds: the lanes a paper needs, how versions sit side by side, and what a send freezes.",
   "originalText": "the paper Board's one `delivery/` (b10 s09-D05, s01-D32): each version's built paper sits under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/` (LaTeX, Word, cover letter), and each Section's own output under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/tNN_<section>/`. haipipe-paper-assemble builds the paper from the Sections' outputs;\nhaipipe-delivery owns the folder and the rule that only a person marks a send done. This topic settles what\npaper adds: the lanes a paper needs, how versions sit side by side, and what a send freezes.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.3
