   "text": "<paper Board>/delivery/\n├── j01_v1009_nmi/latex/   the built paper for one send\n├── j01_v1009_nmi/word/\n├── j01_v1009_nmi/t02_results/latex/   one Section's output\n└── (no Job or Task keeps its own delivery/)",
